{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7BlinkID27InputImageSelectionStrategyO","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkID\/documentation\/BlinkID\/InputImageSelectionStrategy"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Before selecting the best quality image, a sequence of stable input images must be available. From this pool of input images,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the one with the highest quality is selected. An input image is considered stable if the image analysis results are consistent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"across consecutive stream of input images.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A larger pool size increases the likelihood of capturing a high-quality image but may introduce a slight delay,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as more stable input images need to be collected.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Available strategies are: ","type":"text"},{"code":"SingleImage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"OptimizeForSpeed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Balanced","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"OptimizeForQuality","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Default strategy represents a trade-off between speed and quality, while ","type":"text"},{"code":"OptimizeForSpeed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"OptimizeForQuality","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" represent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"strategies optimized for speed and quality, respectively.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This setting is applicable only for ","type":"text"},{"code":"Video","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" input image source.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","title":"inputImageSelectionStrategy","modules":[{"name":"BlinkID"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7BlinkID27InputImageSelectionStrategyO"}],"externalID":"s:7BlinkID29DocumentCaptureModuleSettingsV27inputImageSelectionStrategyAA05InputhiJ0Ovp"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkID\/documentation\/BlinkID\/DocumentCaptureModuleSettings\/inputImageSelectionStrategy"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Represents the strategy used to select the best input image from a pool of stable input images."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/blinkid\/documentcapturemodulesettings\/inputimageselectionstrategy"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkID\/documentation\/BlinkID","doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkID\/documentation\/BlinkID\/DocumentCaptureModuleSettings"]]},"references":{"doc://com.microblink.BlinkID/documentation/BlinkID":{"url":"\/documentation\/blinkid","abstract":[],"title":"BlinkID","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkID\/documentation\/BlinkID","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.microblink.BlinkID/documentation/BlinkID/InputImageSelectionStrategy":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"InputImageSelectionStrategy","kind":"identifie